  "content": {
    "id": "p26-q11-root",
    "type": "question",
    "label": "11",
    "prompt": "Expand and collect like terms in each case.",
    "layout": "grid",
    "columns": 2,
    "questionDiagrams": [],
    "children": [
      {
        "id": "p26-q11-a",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "a",
        "prompt": "$x(2x^2+3x+4)$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$2x^3+3x^2+4x$",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}x(2x^2+3x+4)&=x\\cdot2x^2+x\\cdot3x+x\\cdot4\\\\x(2x^2+3x+4)&=2x^3+3x^2+4x\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 18
      },
      {
        "id": "p26-q11-b",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "b",
        "prompt": "$3a(a^2-4a+1)$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$3a^3-12a^2+3a$",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}3a(a^2-4a+1)&=3a\\cdot a^2-3a\\cdot4a+3a\\cdot1\\\\3a(a^2-4a+1)&=3a^3-12a^2+3a\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 18
      },
      {
        "id": "p26-q11-c",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "c",
        "prompt": "$(m+2)(m^2+3m+2)$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$m^3+5m^2+8m+4$\n\nMultiply each term in the first bracket by every term in the second, then collect like terms.",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}(m+2)(m^2+3m+2)&=m(m^2+3m+2)+2(m^2+3m+2)\\\\(m+2)(m^2+3m+2)&=m^3+3m^2+2m+2m^2+6m+4\\\\(m+2)(m^2+3m+2)&=m^3+5m^2+8m+4\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 42
      },
      {
        "id": "p26-q11-d",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "d",
        "prompt": "$(p-3)(2p^2+5p+3)$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$2p^3-p^2-12p-9$\n\nDistribute both terms, including the negative multiplier, then collect like terms.",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}(p-3)(2p^2+5p+3)&=p(2p^2+5p+3)-3(2p^2+5p+3)\\\\(p-3)(2p^2+5p+3)&=2p^3+5p^2+3p-6p^2-15p-9\\\\(p-3)(2p^2+5p+3)&=2p^3-p^2-12p-9\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 42
      },
      {
        "id": "p26-q11-e",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "e",
        "prompt": "$(x-1)(x^2+x+1)$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$x^3-1$\n\nExpand both products; the quadratic and linear terms cancel.",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}(x-1)(x^2+x+1)&=x(x^2+x+1)-(x^2+x+1)\\\\(x-1)(x^2+x+1)&=x^3+x^2+x-x^2-x-1\\\\(x-1)(x^2+x+1)&=x^3-1\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 42
      },
      {
        "id": "p26-q11-f",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "f",
        "prompt": "$(x+1)(x^2-x+1)$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$x^3+1$\n\nExpand both products; the quadratic and linear terms cancel.",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}(x+1)(x^2-x+1)&=x(x^2-x+1)+(x^2-x+1)\\\\(x+1)(x^2-x+1)&=x^3-x^2+x+x^2-x+1\\\\(x+1)(x^2-x+1)&=x^3+1\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 42
      }
    ]
  },
